This plugin reuses gateway.js and protocol.js from the local dsh-pdf2zh project
(AGPL-3.0). PDFMathTranslate-next 2.10.2 (AGPL-3.0) is bundled under
vendor/PDFMathTranslate-next, without Git metadata or generated caches.
Its upstream revision is recorded in UPSTREAM.json; source and authorship
remain unchanged for the runtime source. Upstream test directories are omitted;
see UPSTREAM.json for the bundled-file exclusions.
BabelDOC is a separate Python runtime dependency.
The static interface translations and language list in lib/locales.json are
derived from PDFMathTranslate-next. The JavaScript UI is a native rewrite.
Full license text is provided in LICENSE.
